{"id":"cd9981d8428c2629","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md","title":"Tangent Space","display":"df-tangent-space — Tangent Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tangent-space","aliases":["58-df-tangent-space"],"display":"df-tangent-space — Tangent Space","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tangent-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tangent-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tangent-space — Tangent Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4aec613831b7dd67\" href=\"?note=4aec613831b7dd67\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md\">../batch19/58-df-tangent.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,M,p,n\\in V\">\\(T,M,p,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（四元上游谓词；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4aec613831b7dd67\" href=\"?note=4aec613831b7dd67\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md\">../batch19/58-df-tangent.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（本文件定义的维数投影）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S(T,M,p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S(T,M,p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}legacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S(T,M,p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}legacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S(T,M,p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>三元兼容式现在是四元上游谓词对维数的存在投影；同名记号按元数区分，保留既有三元下游调用。上游原子展开实线性与 Leibniz 条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aec613831b7dd67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aec613831b7dd67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$（四元上游谓词；see [[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,M,p,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S(T,M,p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\;\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}legacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TangentSpaceAt}_S(T,M,p)","display":true}],"bytes":1015,"backlinks":[{"id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8e70eff045618bab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7056a4392f2b25e2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (tangent-space predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]])"},{"id":"becb68cbe0f3a15e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e5a25c93496ad88","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]])."},{"id":"297834c6f058cefe","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f10cb4e88874efad","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]])."},{"id":"c2477c8e1bc04c16","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"62ba03663f91241e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_pM$ (see [[58-df-tangent-space]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md|58-df-tangent-space]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["4aec613831b7dd67"]}